US-RGB-Memory-DDR5-32GB--2x16GB-6000MT-s> 进一步了解 <svg class="SubTitle__icon ArrowLine" xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg viewBox="0 0 19 30"><path d=M20-30,5-15,20,0l4-4L13-15,24-26Z transform="translate(-5 30)"></path></svg> </a></div></div></div></div><div data-parentid=3 class="l-restrict-container menu-type-enterprise hidden"><div class=menu-section-left><div class=backGroundColor></div><div class=section-left-menuItemArea><a data-id=8 class="left-menuItemArea-Link active NoUrlLinkHaveCursorIcon"> Form Factor </a> <a data-id=58 class="left-menuItemArea-Link NoUrlLinkHaveCursorIcon"> Platform </a> <a data-id=65 class="left-menuItemArea-Link NoUrlLinkHaveCursorIcon"> Application </a></div></div><div class=menu-section-center><div data-parentid=8 class="menu-list show"><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Server-Motherboard> 服务器主板 </a><div class=menu-desc>Three decades of fine-tuning and modularity design have given birth to a wide range of motherboards.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Server-Motherboard?fid=2293">Intel 服务器主板</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Server-Motherboard?fid=2294">AMD 服务器主板</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Workstation-Motherboard> 工作站主板 </a><div class=menu-desc>Professionals that work in AI, animation, and data science rely on solid, scalable, and performant workstation boards.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Workstation-Motherboard?fid=2293">Intel 工作站主板</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Workstation-Motherboard?fid=2294">AMD 工作站主板</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Rack-Server> 机架式服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Performance, efficiency, and reliability wrapped into a versatile server solution.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Rack-Server?fid=2228">1U 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Rack-Server?fid=2229">2U 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Rack-Server?fid=2230">4U 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/GPU-Server> GPU 计算服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Scalable parallel computing GPU dense servers that are built for high performance.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/GPU-Server?fid=2233">2 GPU</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/GPU-Server?fid=2234">4 GPU</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/GPU-Server?fid=2235">8 GPU</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/High-Density-Server> 高密度服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Compute, Storage, and Networking are possible in high density, multi-node servers at lower TCO and greater efficiency.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/High-Density-Server?fid=2361">2U 2-Node</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/High-Density-Server?fid=2355">2U 4-Node</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Tower-Server> 工作站 </a><div class=menu-desc>Stand-alone chassis for customers to customize and expand as needs change.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-12"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Advanced-Cooling> 先进散热方案 </a><div class=menu-desc>Diverse cooling solutions greatly improve efficiency in the data center and offer more computing power in a densely packed rack.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Advanced-Cooling?fid=2722">直接液体冷却</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Advanced-Cooling?fid=2723">浸没式液冷</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Accessory?fid=2769">浸没式液冷冷却液槽</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Data-Center> OCP开源服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Based on OCP Open Rack Standards, barebone racks and nodes for datacenters.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Accessory> 服务器配件 </a></div></div><div data-parentid=58 class="menu-list hidden"><div class="menu-level-4 col-12"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/x86-Server> x86 服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Tried and true x86 architecture based servers with support for new Intel and AMD processors.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/x86-Server?fid=2296">Intel Xeon 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/x86-Server?fid=2359">AMD EPYC 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/x86-Server?fid=2859">AMD Ryzen 服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-12"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/ARM-Server> ARM 服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Arm architecture servers will compete in Cloud to Edge as they tackle compute-bound workloads.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/ARM-Server?fid=2494">Ampere</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/ARM-Server?fid=2896">NVIDIA</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div></div><div data-parentid=65 class="menu-list hidden"><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2260"> 人工智能平台 </a><div class=menu-desc>Processing power, large amounts of data, fast networking, and accelerators all bundle into a scale out ready HPC and/or AI server solution.</div><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2363">人工智能训练服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2364">人工智能推理服务器</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2261"> 视觉计算 </a><div class=menu-desc>Systems that do visual applications from computer graphics to computer animation rely on visual computing servers.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2262"> 高性能计算平台 </a><div class=menu-desc>Processing power, large amounts of data, fast networking, and accelerators all bundle into a scale out ready HPC and/or AI server solution.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2263"> 超融合服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Software defined cluster of nodes can be dedicated for compute, storage, networking, or virtualization.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Storage-Server> 储存服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Storage dense servers require flexibility in scaling up and in choice of storage options, which include U.2/SATA/SAS in 2.5", 3.5", NVMe AIC and M.2</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href=/Enterprise/Embedded-Computing> 嵌入式主板 </a><div class=menu-item><div class=menu-item-content><a class=menu-item-content-Link href="/Enterprise/Embedded-Computing?fid=1750">工业级主板</a><span class=TextBorder>&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2266"> 网络服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Securely manage the use of files and applications for office environments while storing large amounts of data.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2362"> 混合/私有云服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Server resources are effectively allocated via virtualization, and these servers are highly flexible.</div></div><div class="menu-level-4 col-6"><a class=menu-title href="/Enterprise/Server?fid=2267"> 边缘计算服务器 </a><div class=menu-desc>Computation and analytics are done closer to the source rather than in a far away data center.</div></div></div></div><div class=menu-section-right><div class=menu-ad-list><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_R.png alt="&lt;b>R&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/R-Series><b>R</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/R-Series>Rack Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_X.png alt="&lt;b>X&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/X-Series><b>X</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/X-Series>MGX Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_G.png alt="&lt;b>G&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/G-Series><b>G</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/G-Series>GPU Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_H.png alt="&lt;b>H&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/H-Series><b>H</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/H-Series>High Density Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_E.png alt="&lt;b>E&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/E-Series><b>E</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/E-Series>Edge Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_S.png alt="&lt;b>S&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/S-Series><b>S</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/S-Series>Storage Server</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_W.png alt="&lt;b>W&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/W-Series><b>W</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/W-Series>Tower Server / Workstation</a></div><div class=menu-ad-item><img class="menu-ad-image lazy-HeaderMenu lazyFadeIn" data-src=/Images/TopMenu/Series_OCP.png alt="&lt;b>OCP&lt;/b> Series"> <a class=menu-ad-title href=/Enterprise/OCP-Series><b>OCP</b> Series</a> <a class=menu-ad-desc href=/Enterprise/OCP-Series>Open Compute Project</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=navBar-Mobile><ul class="header-Directory-Mobile content-menu"><li class=navBar-RowFirst-Mobile><nav class="l-restrict-container RowFirst-Container"> <a class=navLink-Mobile href=/Consumer title=个人应用> 个人应用 <svg class=ArrowLine xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg viewBox="0 0 19 30"><path d=M20-30,5-15,20,0l4-4L13-15,24-26Z transform="translate(-5 30)"></path></svg> </a><div class=navLink-borderLine>&nbsp</div><a class=navLink-Mobile href=/Enterprise title=企业应用> 企业应用 <svg class=ArrowLine xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg viewBox="0 0 19 30"><path d=M20-30,5-15,20,0l4-4L13-15,24-26Z transform="translate(-5 30)"></path></svg> </a> </nav><li class="menuHeader menu-header-1" data-haschild=true data-headerid=1><div class=titleContainer><a class="NoUrlLinkHaveCursorIcon mobileMenuFadeOutButton"> <span class=